//RS /// c109 Phase 13: does this AST arg expression emit as a `Box::new(…)` (a bare
//RS /// fn-name value via `emit_named_fn_value`)? That is exactly an `Expr::Ident` which
//RS /// is NOT a local and resolves to a `Type::Fn` in `cx.fn_types` (a top-level fn used
//RS /// as a value). Mirrors `emit_expr`'s `Expr::Ident` arm + `emit_call_args`'
